### ============================================
### RENDER - USERS 
### ============================================

### 1. Get all users (Success 200)
GET https://cse341-music-playlists.onrender.com/api/users

### 2. Get user by ID (Success 200) - Replace ID with a real one from your DB
GET https://cse341-music-playlists.onrender.com/api/users/66abc123def4567890abcdef

### 3. Get user by ID (Error 400 CastError) - Invalid ID format
GET https://cse341-music-playlists.onrender.com/api/users/123

### 4. Get user by ID (Error 404 Not Found) - Valid format but doesn't exist
GET https://cse341-music-playlists.onrender.com/api/users/000000000000000000000000

### 5. Create user (Success 201)
POST https://cse341-music-playlists.onrender.com/api/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Jesus Tortolero",
  "email": "jesus.test@example.com",
  "password": "supersecretpassword",
  "role": "user"
}

### 6. Create user (Error 400 Validation) - Missing email and short password
POST https://cse341-music-playlists.onrender.com/api/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "John Doe",
  "password": "123"
}

### 7. Create user (Error 400 Validation) - Invalid email format
POST https://cse341-music-playlists.onrender.com/api/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Jane Doe",
  "email": "not-an-email",
  "password": "securepassword123"
}

### 8. Create user (Error 409 Conflict) - Duplicate email
# NOTE: Run Request 5 first. Then run this one with the same email.
POST https://cse341-music-playlists.onrender.com/api/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Another Jesus",
  "email": "jesus.test@example.com",
  "password": "anotherpassword123",
  "role": "admin"
}

### 9. Update user (Success 200) - Replace ID with a real one
PUT https://cse341-music-playlists.onrender.com/api/users/66abc123def4567890abcdef
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Jesus Tortolero Updated",
  "role": "admin"
}

### 10. Update user (Error 404) - Valid format but doesn't exist
PUT https://cse341-music-playlists.onrender.com/api/users/000000000000000000000000
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "This will fail"
}

### 11. Delete user (Success 200) - Replace ID with a real one
DELETE https://cse341-music-playlists.onrender.com/api/users/66abc123def4567890abcdef

### 12. Delete user (Error 404) - Valid format but doesn't exist
DELETE https://cse341-music-playlists.onrender.com/api/users/000000000000000000000000